 first description paragraph into one generated summary.'","'Stop summary extraction at the next paragraph.'","Absence: no definition of the paragraph delimiter is given, though wrapped-line joining vs paragraph-splitting hinges on it."],"finding":"The plan defines summary extraction in terms of 'first description paragraph' and 'stop at the next paragraph' but never states what delimits a paragraph boundary (blank line? explicit newline? sentence-based?), leaving the executor to infer the boundary rule.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff050a7706c639b26","impact":0.264,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan bullets 1-2 / AC 'Wrapped descriptions render as one complete summary' and 'Paragraphs after the summary remain excluded'","norm_id":"n134d34d448000133","priority":0.132,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A description with single-newline wrapping inside one logical paragraph could be mis-split if the executor treats any newline as a paragraph break, re-introducing the truncation bug."],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Add a bullet: 'A paragraph ends at the first blank line (double newline); single-newline wrapped lines within a paragraph are joined into one summary.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"